  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This line shapefile depicts the Alquist Priolo faults within Monterey County, California. These data were created using TIFF images accessed through the State of California Dept. of Conservation website. TIFFs were georeferenced and faults lines were traced.This layer is part of a collection of GIS data for Monterey County in California.",
